Derived files and changes:

  bench/reviews.jsonl
    From TrialReviewBench-study-search-screening.jsonl, only the reviews with PMID 33746596,
    31190844 and 37168849 (scripts/build_bench.py). PMID, PICO and Topic are kept as they are;
    Involved_Citations becomes "included_pmids", a list of the cited PMIDs as strings.
    Title and Abstract are not included.

  bench/extraction/33746596.jsonl
  bench/extraction/37168849.jsonl
    From TrialReviewBench-data-extraction/<PMID>.csv (scripts/build_extraction.py).
    One JSON Lines record per study: the PMID column becomes "pmid" (trimmed string);
    the column names and values are kept unchanged.

The raw TrialReviewBench files are not included; scripts download them into bench/raw/.
